-- a measurement as the knowledge graph must hold it: the molecule observed, the warrant the report
-- rests on — a type, with an inhabitant of it — and the value reported. The warrant is not a
-- citation field; it is the proposition whose truth the number depends on, carried with the number.
Report : Type 0 → Type 1
Report V = (M : Mol) × (W : Type 0) × W × V
